{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And this is his impurity.</b> The meaning is that the flux is in two ways:" "<b>A discharge from his flesh.</b> From the root of ויורד רירו על זקנו (\"and his spittle runs down upon his beard\")." "<b>Or if it is sealed.</b> Like נסגר (\"is closed up\"), from the root of כי חתום הוא (\"for it is sealed\"), and the meaning is that the flux combined and congealed, and the seminal emission did not go forth when he lay with a woman."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:16.097875837Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}